        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Runner2 is the sequel to the critically acclaimed and IGF award winning BIT.TRIP RUNNER.,In the style of the BIT.TRIP series, Runner2 is a rhythm-music platforming game.,Players will run through fantastic environments, using brand new moves, to brand new soundtracks as they run, jump, slide, kick, and soar toward the goal of tracking down the Timbletot and thwarting his evil plans to destroy not only our world, but every world there is.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Runner2 es la secuela del aclamado BIT.TRIP RUNNER, ganador de un premio IGF.\n\nAl estilo de la serie BIT.TRIP, Runner2 es un juego de plataformas con ritmo musical.\n\nLos jugadores recorrerán entornos fantásticos usando movimientos totalmente nuevos y con nuevas bandas sonoras mientras corren, saltan, se deslizan, patean y se elevan con el objetivo de dar caza al Timbletot y frustrar sus malvados planes de destruir no solo nuestro mundo, sino todos los mundos que existen.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2013",
          "source": "igdb",
